# Dockerfile-specific allowlist, relative to the repository-root context.
# Keep worktrees, credentials, dependencies and generated targets out.
**
!engine/
!engine/rs/
!engine/rs/Cargo.toml
!engine/rs/Cargo.lock
!engine/rs/orgtree-engine/
!engine/rs/orgtree-engine/**
!engine/rs/orgtree-logged/
!engine/rs/orgtree-logged/**
!engine/docs/
!engine/docs/charters/
!engine/docs/charters/**
!engine/docs/templates/
!engine/docs/templates/**
!docs/
!docs/skills/
!docs/skills/**
# The Changelog: the release list and stable releases' notes, not drafts.
!docs/releases.json
!docs/release-notes-*.md
docs/release-notes-*-*.md
# The custom-apps example a template test reads with include_str!.
!docs/examples/
!docs/examples/apps/
!docs/examples/apps/annotation-notes.orgtree-app
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.cargo
**/.claude
